------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party sources this library is transcoded from
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Several files in src\ are hand transcodings of public C reference
implementations into C#.  Each such file names its source project, file,
version and commit in a lineage comment at the top.  Every one of those
sources is permissive or public domain, which is what allows this library to
offer the MIT arm above:

    stb_image.h, stb_image_write.h, stb_image_resize2.h
        nothings/stb -- dual licensed MIT OR public domain (Unlicense).
        Copyright (c) 2017 Sean Barrett.

    qoi.h
        phoboslab/qoi -- MIT.  Copyright (c) 2021 Dominic Szablewski.

    msf_gif.h
        notnullnotvoid/msf_gif -- dual licensed MIT OR public domain.

    gif.h
        charlietangora/gif-h -- Unlicense (public domain).

    lodepng.h, lodepng.cpp
        lvandeve/lodepng -- zlib license.  Copyright (c) 2005-2026
        Lode Vandevenne.

No third-party code is redistributed here verbatim, and no third-party
binary or package is bundled.  The transcodings are derivative works of the
sources named above; their original license terms are satisfied by the
attribution in each file's lineage comment and by this notice.

